{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18263","headline":"韶州留别张端公使君 · 韩愈","name":"韶州留别张端公使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来往再逢梅柳新，别离一醉绮罗春。\n久钦江总文才妙，自叹虞翻骨相屯。\n鸣笛急吹争落日，清歌缓送款行人。\n已知奏课当徵拜，那复淹留咏白苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}